= Rochus von Rheinbaben

Baron Rochus von Rheinbaben is a politician and activist often tasked with reaching out to other non-socialist republican parties.

- @media_
- @build_support_liberal_peoples_party: Build support for a united liberal party
- @negotiate_minor_parties
- @root: Return to main

@media_
title: Media
subtitle: Manage our party's newspapers and media.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: media


@build_support_liberal_peoples_party
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if ddp_relation < 50: Our relations with [+ ddp_name +] are not good enough. ?]
view-if: not lvp_formed and not nfvp_formed
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and ddp_relation >= 50
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; liberal_peoples_party_timer = 6; liberal_peoples_party_progress += 1; liberal_strength += 5; nationalist_strength -= 5; nationalist_dissent += 5; dvp_left += 1; ddp_relation += 3; ddp_right += 1; dnvp_relation -= 2; dnvp_relation -= 5 if dnvp_leader = "Hugenberg"

We are pushing forward proposals for a united liberal party against the nationalists within our party. We are also building ties with [+ ddp_name +] organizations.


